[00:19.04]1. How great our need today for discernment,
[00:25.76]To know the things that are true,
[00:31.36]To know which things have greater importance,
[00:37.42]To know which things we must do!
[00:42.54](Chorus)
[00:43.08]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[00:49.10]Make God’s heart glad;
[00:52.06]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[00:57.72]When we discern,
[01:01.04]And when we do the important things!
[01:07.88]2. And what could be of greater importance
[01:13.96]Than sharing Kingdom good news,
[01:20.64]To search for those who hunger for truth
[01:26.14]And to help them God’s way to choose?
[01:31.92](Chorus)
[01:31.92]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[01:37.26]Make God’s heart glad;
[01:40.40]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[01:47.12]When we discern,
[01:50.04]And when we do the important things!
[02:07.40]3. If we take care to do what’s important,
[02:14.12]Then true contentment we’ll find.
[02:20.56]The peace surpassing all understanding
[02:26.28]Will guard our heart and our mind.
[02:31.72](Chorus)
[02:31.72]Love what is good; Hate what is bad.
[02:37.74]Make God’s heart glad;
[02:40.60]Oh, what rich blessings it brings when we learn,
[02:46.64]When we discern,
[02:49.90]And when we do the important things!
